                            (published in f3bandit/super-memcard-cores)
  main/smc_frontport.cpp    the front-port access compiled into a MiSTer Main (Main_MiSTer is
  main/smc_frontport.h      GPL-3.0)
  main/smc_shim.cpp         the Main shim that passes card frames between a MiSTer Main and smcd
